  <suppress>
    <notes><![CDATA[
    CVE-2026-104828 affects HTMLWriterFilter when serializing textarea/title text.
    The reviewed CMS uses Neko through wjdaisydiff in DocTools.getHtmlDiff().
    NekoHtmlParser creates a SAXParser and forwards events to the DaisyDiff content
    handler; the result is serialized through HtmlSaxDiffOutput and SAX/XSL
    transformers. Inspection of the resolved dependencies and local DaisyDiff JAR
    confirms that this path does not instantiate or configure HTMLWriterFilter.
    This is non-applicability in the reviewed integration, not a patched Neko
    library or accepted residual risk. Reassess when Neko/DaisyDiff versions,
    HTML output handling or custom integrations change, especially if
    HTMLWriterFilter is introduced. Verified on 2026-10-29. Reference:
    https://github.com/HtmlUnit/htmlunit-neko/security/advisories/GHSA-39xg-prhf-8785
    ]]></notes>
    <packageUrl>pkg:maven/org.htmlunit/neko-htmlunit@4.5.0</packageUrl>
    <cve>CVE-2026-104828</cve>
  </suppress>

</suppressions>
